  "contentHtml": "<p>생물의 다양성과 생태계 도입 활동으로 좋은 (철저히 흥미위주의 활동&#128525;) 숨은 동물 찾기 입니다.</p><p>2년 전 1학년 맡았을 때 소개해드렸었는데 ( <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1356\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1356 </a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1356\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=1356\" data-og-image=\"\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1356\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1356\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>선생님들 댓글 올라올 때 마다,, 이번에는 꼭 스캔해서 올려야지 올려야지~하다가,, 2년만에 올려요</p><p>앗! 생각해보니, 이번에도 스캔을 하다 말아 답지가 없습니다!! 개학하자 마자 올릴께욤 진짜요~</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acbf8f097e380302416b227ee0880bac82a83530?download\" data-file-name=\"나일강1.jpg\" data-file-size=\"5366654\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D87%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20230724230400&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Facbf8f097e380302416b227ee0880bac82a83530')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">나일강1</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">5.12MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1T